sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModuleOp as ray-module-operator<br/>8081/TCP (health) 8443/TCP (metrics)
    participant KubeRay as kuberay-operator<br/>8080/TCP (metrics) 8082/TCP (health)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant User as Data Scientist

    Note over PlatformOp,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Module Reconciliation

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create Ray CR "default-ray"<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>ModuleOp: Watch event: Ray CR created<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read odh-ray-config ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: ConfigMap data (distribution, version)

    Note over ModuleOp: Reconciliation Pipeline:<br/>1. Management state eval<br/>2. Release tracking<br/>3. Manifest init (copy to writable tmp)<br/>4. Image param injection (RELATED_IMAGE)<br/>5. Kustomize render<br/>6. cert-manager CRD check<br/>7. Platform resource filter (SCC)<br/>8. Notebook RBAC (ray ClusterRole)<br/>9. Server-Side Apply

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA apply operand resources<br/>(CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, Webhooks)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Apply result
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Update Ray CR status<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over Prometheus,KubeRay: Flow 2: Metrics Scrape

    Prometheus->>KubeRay: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP 8080/TCP<br/>prometheus.io/scrape annotation
    KubeRay-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over User,KubeRay: Flow 3: User Workload (via operand)

    User->>K8sAPI: Create RayJob / RayCluster CR
    K8sAPI->>KubeRay: Watch event
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Create Ray worker pods, Services
    KubeRay->>K8sAPI: Create Routes / HTTPRoutes<br/>(Ray Dashboard access)
